        <briefdescription>
<para>NRG-P3: QUIC 0-RTT resumption path overhead. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Gate: ≤ 50 ms per handshake.</para>
<para><bold>Stub basis:</bold> Models session ticket lookup + 2-round key schedule step + anti-replay check. The real 0-RTT path adds TLS AEAD decryption overhead and a UDP round-trip; this stub isolates the in-process cost.</para>
<para><bold>Hardware baseline pending:</bold> Real QUIC 0-RTT measurements require the THEMIS_ENABLE_HTTP3 build and a loopback network. This stub establishes the gate before hardware numbers are collected. </para>
